---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="Contact SecureByteGuide for corrections, source questions, privacy requests, and partnerships.">
  <article class="container mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 py-16 md:py-24 max-w-3xl">
    <header class="mb-12"><p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] font-mono text-accent mb-4">SecureByteGuide · Trust</p><h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold leading-[0.95] mb-4" style="font-family:var(--font-display);">Contact</h1><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Last updated: September 6, 2026</p></header>
    <div class="prose-article space-y-8 text-[16px] leading-[1.75]">
<section><h2>Email</h2><p>Send corrections, source questions, privacy requests, permissions, or partnership inquiries to <a href="mailto:editor@securebyteguide.org">editor@securebyteguide.org</a>.</p></section>
<section><h2>What to include</h2><p>For an article correction, include the page URL, the sentence or section at issue, and a public source that helps explain the concern. For a broken link, include the destination that failed. Do not email passwords, one-time codes, recovery codes, authentication QR images, government identification, payment-card details, malware samples, or confidential employer data.</p></section>
<section><h2>Security and emergency limits</h2><p>This mailbox is not an emergency service, help desk, managed-security provider, bank fraud line, or incident-response hotline. For active financial fraud, contact the financial institution through a verified channel. For workplace systems, notify the authorized administrator. For immediate danger, contact local emergency services.</p></section>
<section><h2>Commercial messages</h2><p>Partnership inquiries must identify the organization and proposed relationship. Payment does not guarantee coverage, placement, or a favorable recommendation. Applicable commercial relationships are disclosed to readers.</p></section></div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
